  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "SpiritSwap is a decentralized exchange and lending protocol on Sonic and Fantom. It provides automated market making with concentrated liquidity, yield farming incentives, and lending markets for users to swap tokens, provide liquidity, and earn rewards.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The Swaps/Liquidity family provides the core AMM infrastructure, with the AlgebraFactory deploying pools and the NonfungiblePositionManager managing LP positions. The Farming family builds on top by allowing users to stake those LP positions in the FarmingCenter to earn rewards from AlgebraEternalFarming. The legacy SpiritSwap AMM contracts appear to be separate, possibly an older version, and may not directly interact with the Algebra-based families.",
